# TrailShop sample requests. Open in Visual Studio and click "Send request".
# Demo users (synthetic): alice, bob, carol, admin. The X-Demo-User header is a
# training stand-in for real authentication.

@host = http://localhost:5080

### List products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Search products
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?q=tent

### Get one product
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### Get a product by SKU
GET {{host}}/api/products/by-sku/TS-BOOT-M42

### Alice reads her own order
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1
X-Demo-User: alice

### Quote for an order
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1/quote
X-Demo-User: alice

### Product page (Razor)
GET {{host}}/products/1
